| ARMAX, a = 0.5 | 0.50 | 0.508 (0.059) | 0.90 | 0.498 (0.035) | 0.478 (0.040) |
| ARMAX, a = 0.2 | 0.80 | 0.811 (0.067) | 0.88 | 0.785 (0.030) | 0.737 (0.069) |
